      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Updated the title to be a little clearer, as well as commenting to confirm this is still happening and has somehow gotten worse? I've noticed that it will now (VERY RARELY) seem to ignore the whole \"First time a player sends a message\" thing and will very rarely play at max volume multiple times for the same person. I noticed this in the NYE 2024 world and idling at the Super VR Ball spawn, if that matters.\n\nI really hope this gets investigated sooner rather than later because my worry is that people will become so desensitized to hearing the notification sound, realizing it was the volume bug, and turning away that when this gets fixed the damage will already be done and people won't be as willing to turning their heads to read actual chats. I've already had this happen to me a couple times.",
